%!PS  H1: EndPage hook, lines on page 3 only
/Overlays 10 dict def
Overlays 3 { 1 0 0 setrgbcolor 1 setlinewidth
             newpath  50 30 moveto 562 30 lineto stroke      % horizontal
             newpath 590 50 moveto 590 742 lineto stroke } put % vertical
<< /EndPage { dup 2 ne
     { exch 1 add Overlays exch 2 copy known
       { get gsave initgraphics exec grestore } { pop pop } ifelse pop true }
     { pop pop false } ifelse } bind >> setpagedevice
